        "english_script": [
          {
            "id": 0,
            "narration": "I left before dawn, wondering why I'd dragged myself out into the cold.",
            "duration": 7,
            "original_tts_seconds": 5.208,
            "speed_factor": 1,
            "path": "/Users/x/X/space/spur/V2/docs/OpenMontage\u963f\u5c14\u5351\u65af\u5c71\u5341\u4e94\u6761\u8bb0\u5f55\u5236\u4f5c\u516d\u5341\u79d2\u65c5\u884c\u89c6\u9891\u9a8c\u8bc1-2026\u5e7411\u670809\u65e5/\u82f1\u6587Sonia\u6210\u7247/audio/0.wav",
            "recording_ids": [
              1
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1,
            "narration": "Then the first light caught the peaks. Some moments just don't fit inside a photograph.",
            "duration": 7,
            "original_tts_seconds": 6.336,
            "speed_factor": 1,
            "path": "/Users/x/X/space/spur/V2/docs/OpenMontage\u963f\u5c14\u5351\u65af\u5c71\u5341\u4e94\u6761\u8bb0\u5f55\u5236\u4f5c\u516d\u5341\u79d2\u65c5\u884c\u89c6\u9891\u9a8c\u8bc1-2026\u5e7411\u670809\u65e5/\u82f1\u6587Sonia\u6210\u7247/audio/1.wav",
            "recording_ids": [
              2
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2,
            "narration": "But the trail got rough. My legs ached. For a while, I really wanted to turn back.",
            "duration": 8,
            "original_tts_seconds": 7.032,
            "speed_factor": 1,
            "path": "/Users/x/X/space/spur/V2/docs/OpenMontage\u963f\u5c14\u5351\u65af\u5c71\u5341\u4e94\u6761\u8bb0\u5f55\u5236\u4f5c\u516d\u5341\u79d2\u65c5\u884c\u89c6\u9891\u9a8c\u8bc1-2026\u5e7411\u670809\u65e5/\u82f1\u6587Sonia\u6210\u7247/audio/2.wav",
            "recording_ids": [
              3,
              6
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
            "narration": "An old man on the path told me, 'Don't rush to the top. Take your time.'",
            "duration": 8,
            "original_tts_seconds": 5.592,
            "speed_factor": 1,
            "path": "/Users/x/X/space/spur/V2/docs/OpenMontage\u963f\u5c14\u5351\u65af\u5c71\u5341\u4e94\u6761\u8bb0\u5f55\u5236\u4f5c\u516d\u5341\u79d2\u65c5\u884c\u89c6\u9891\u9a8c\u8bc1-2026\u5e7411\u670809\u65e5/\u82f1\u6587Sonia\u6210\u7247/audio/3.wav",
            "recording_ids": [
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "narration": "So I put my phone away. Cowbells, wind... bread and cheese. Somehow, it was enough.",
            "duration": 8,
            "original_tts_seconds": 7.728,
            "speed_factor": 1.0235761589403973,
            "path": "/Users/x/X/space/spur/V2/docs/OpenMontage\u963f\u5c14\u5351\u65af\u5c71\u5341\u4e94\u6761\u8bb0\u5f55\u5236\u4f5c\u516d\u5341\u79d2\u65c5\u884c\u89c6\u9891\u9a8c\u8bc1-2026\u5e7411\u670809\u65e5/\u82f1\u6587Sonia\u6210\u7247/audio/4.wav",
            "recording_ids": [
              4,
              8,
              9
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 5,
            "narration": "Then the clouds lifted. The whole valley opened up. I just stood there, saying nothing.",
            "duration": 8,
            "original_tts_seconds": 6.96,
            "speed_factor": 1,
            "path": "/Users/x/X/space/spur/V2/docs/OpenMontage\u963f\u5c14\u5351\u65af\u5c71\u5341\u4e94\u6761\u8bb0\u5f55\u5236\u4f5c\u516d\u5341\u79d2\u65c5\u884c\u89c6\u9891\u9a8c\u8bc1-2026\u5e7411\u670809\u65e5/\u82f1\u6587Sonia\u6210\u7247/audio/5.wav",
            "recording_ids": [
              7,
              10
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 6,
            "narration": "The hard part passed. From up here, the things I'd worried about felt so small.",
            "duration": 7,
            "original_tts_seconds": 6.12,
            "speed_factor": 1,
            "path": "/Users/x/X/space/spur/V2/docs/OpenMontage\u963f\u5c14\u5351\u65af\u5c71\u5341\u4e94\u6761\u8bb0\u5f55\u5236\u4f5c\u516d\u5341\u79d2\u65c5\u884c\u89c6\u9891\u9a8c\u8bc1-2026\u5e7411\u670809\u65e5/\u82f1\u6587Sonia\u6210\u7247/audio/6.wav",
            "recording_ids": [
              11,
              12
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 7,
            "narration": "By dusk, the village lights felt like home. What I'd found was my own pace.",
            "duration": 7,
            "original_tts_seconds": 6.144,
            "speed_factor": 1,
            "path": "/Users/x/X/space/spur/V2/docs/OpenMontage\u963f\u5c14\u5351\u65af\u5c71\u5341\u4e94\u6761\u8bb0\u5f55\u5236\u4f5c\u516d\u5341\u79d2\u65c5\u884c\u89c6\u9891\u9a8c\u8bc1-2026\u5e7411\u670809\u65e5/\u82f1\u6587Sonia\u6210\u7247/audio/7.wav",
